 } } \right]$$

$$ \because $$ |adj (M)| = |M|<sup>2</sup> = $$\left[ {\matrix{
   { - 1} &amp; 1 &amp; { - 1}  \cr 
   8 &amp; { - 6} &amp; 2  \cr 
