$$ \Rightarrow $$ $$|M{|^2} =  - 1(6 - 6) - 1( - 8 + 10) - 1(24 - 30) =  - 2 + 6 = 4$$

$$ \Rightarrow $$ $$|M| =  \pm 2$$

$$ \therefore $$ det (adj M<sup>2</sup>) = $$|{M^2}{|^2} = |M{|^4} = 16$$

As we know A(adj A) = |A| I

